### 🔑 Key Features & Capabilities

#### 1. Performance Accelerations
*   **WMMA Flash-Attention:** Native BF16 Flash-Attention using0.45.687.544 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    367, tg =  21.22 t/s, tg_3s =  21.21 t/s
 Wave Matrix Multiply Accumulate (WMMA) instructions.
    *   *RDNA4:* Full support.
